# ORIENTATIONS - ms-registration-spring-boot

This file is the implementation playbook for this repository.

Use it to validate whether a change follows project standards in three moments:
1. Before implementing
2. During implementation
3. After implementation

If a change passes this playbook checklist, it is compliant with the project baseline.

