## Project Snapshot

- **What**: `ms-registration-spring-boot` (a.k.a. "Voy Registration") is a REST API for the User registration domain of the Voy platform (CRUD of Users).
- **Stack**: Java 11, Spring Boot 2.7.5 (Web, Validation, Data JPA, Flyway, Actuator, DevTools), PostgreSQL (H2 for tests), Lombok, springdoc-openapi (Swagger), Maven.
- **Type**: Backend microservice — there is **no mobile/frontend layer** in this repo. There is no View/ViewModel; the inbound port is the REST API (`application/controller`).
- **Repository**: `VoyOfficial/ms-registration-spring-boot`, default base branch `main`.

