## Reuse-First Rule (Mandatory)

Before creating a new UseCase/Service/validation annotation/config, search first in:
- `src/main/java/src/domain/usecase/` and `src/main/java/src/domain/service/` (similar business action already implemented for another aggregate)
- `src/main/java/src/application/validation/` (custom Bean Validation constraints already implemented)
- `src/main/java/src/infrastructure/config/` (technical configuration already centralized)

Only create new when reuse/adaptation is not viable.

