## Placement Guide (Short)

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| Business entity | `src/main/java/src/domain/entity/` |
| Domain exception | `src/main/java/src/domain/exception/` |
| Repository contract | `src/main/java/src/domain/repository/` |
| Business action (usecase interface) | `src/main/java/src/domain/usecase/` |
| Business action (implementation) | `src/main/java/src/domain/service/` |
| REST endpoint | `src/main/java/src/application/controller/` |
| Request DTO + Bean Validation | `src/main/java/src/application/controller/request/` |
| Response DTO | `src/main/java/src/application/controller/response/` |
| Custom Bean Validation constraint | `src/main/java/src/application/validation/` |
| Exception -> HTTP status mapping | `src/main/java/src/application/interceptor/ExceptionHandlerAdvice.java` |
| JPA entity (persistence model) | `src/main/java/src/infrastructure/model/` |
| Spring Data JPA repository | `src/main/java/src/infrastructure/repository/jpa/` |
| Repository implementation | `src/main/java/src/infrastructure/repository/relational/` |
| Technical config (OpenAPI, i18n, etc.) | `src/main/java/src/infrastructure/config/` |
| DB migration | `src/main/resources/db/migration/` |
| i18n messages | `src/main/resources/messages.properties` |
| Test data builder | `src/test/java/src/[Nome]Datas.java` |

